  │    17 - | hegemony | 霸權、霸主地位 | Their economic hegemony shaped global trade for decades. |                                                                        │
  │    18 - | supremacy | 至高無上的地位、霸權 | The two giants are battling for tech supremacy. |                                                                          │
  │    19 - | top spot | 龍頭位置、第一名 | They overtook their rival to claim the top spot. |                                                                              [38;2;108;112;134m│
  │    16 + | reconstruction | 重建、復原 | The city used its reconstruction fund to rebuild after the earthquake. |                                                        │
  │    17 + | fund | 基金、專款 | The government set up a fund to help small businesses recover. |                                                                          │
  │    18 + | rebuild | 重建、改建 | They plan to rebuild the old district next year. |                                                                                     │
  │    [38;2;108;112;134m19                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    20   ## 5. Useful Sentence Pattern                                                                                                                                   │
  │    21                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    22   **Pattern:**                                                                                                                                                    │
  [38;2;108;112;134m│    24 - to hold / secure / maintain a dominant position in ___                                                                                                          │
  │    23 + a ___ fund (一筆用於 ___ 的基金)                                                                                                                                │
  │    24                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    25   **Example:**                                                                                                                                                    │
  │    27 - Apple has maintained a dominant position in the wearable market for years.                                                                                      │
  │    26 + a disaster relief fund (災難救助基金)                                                                                                                           │
  │    27                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    28   ## 6. Speaking Version                                                                                                                                          │
  │    29                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    31 - They're at the top — nobody can touch their number one spot right now.                                                                                          │
  │    30 + money set aside for rebuilding                                                                                                                                  │
  │    31                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    32   ## 7. Common Mistake                                                                                                                                            │
  │    33                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    35 - Don't say: "boss status" or "overlord position" when you mean a market leader.                                                                                  │
  │    36 - Say: "dominant position" or "market leadership" — these are the natural English terms for 霸主地位 in business contexts.                                        │
  │    34 + Don't say: "rebuild fund"                                                                                                                                       │
  │    35 + Say: "reconstruction fund" or "rebuilding fund"                                                                                                                 │
  │    36 + (「重建」當形容詞修飾 fund 時，用名詞 reconstruction 或動名詞 rebuilding，不用動詞原形 rebuild。)                                                               │
  │    37                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    38   ## 8. One Sentence to Remember                                                                                                                                  │
  │    39                                                                                                                                                                   │
  │    40 - They hold a dominant position in the market.                                                                                                                    │
  │    40 + Reconstruction fund                                                                                                                                             │
