    6. Speaking Version

    money set aside for rebuilding

    7. Common Mistake

    Don't say: "rebuild fund"
    Say: "reconstruction fund" or "rebuilding fund"
    (「重建」當形容詞修飾 fund 時，用名詞 reconstruction 或動名詞 rebuilding，不用動詞原形 rebuild。)

    8. One Sentence to Remember

    Reconstruction fund

